+/*
+ * Query-marker state machine (plan sec 5.3):
+ *
+ *   IDLE --(QueryStart|UtilityStart|ExecStart)--> OPEN
+ *   OPEN --(ExecEnd at depth 0|UtilityEnd|TxnCommit|TxnAbort)--> AFTER_STATEMENT
